### Start application with Payara Platform
GET http://localhost:8080/data-1.0.0/
Content-Type: text/html

### Start application with Eclipse GlassFish
GET http://localhost:8081/
Content-Type: text/html

### Start base application with Eclipse GlassFish
GET http://localhost:8081/data
Content-Type: text/html

### Get list of beers from the database with Eclipse GlassFish
GET http://localhost:8081/data/beer
Content-Type: */*

### Get the list of brewers from the database with Eclipse GlassFish
GET http://localhost:8081/data/brewer
Content-Type: */*
